26:39.640 --> 26:40.119
Baik.

26:43.480 --> 26:43.880
Fei Ting

26:44.200 --> 26:44.599
Lin Mei

26:44.799 --> 26:45.119
Mak.

26:45.240 --> 26:45.559
Ayah.

26:46.519 --> 26:47.039
